
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>KJBM Official Website</title>
<style>
*{box-sizing:border-box}
body{margin:0;background:#080808;color:white;font-family:Arial,sans-serif}
header{text-align:center;padding:35px 12px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#000,#493400,#000)}
.logo{font-size:48px;font-weight:bold;color:#ffd700;text-shadow:3px 3px 8px #b8860b}
header p{color:#eee}
nav{background:#171717;text-align:center;padding:14px;position:sticky;top:0}
nav a{color:#ffd700;text-decoration:none;margin:7px;font-weight:bold;display:inline-block}
section{padding:28px 18px;max-width:950px;margin:auto}
h2{color:#ffd700;border-bottom:2px solid #b8860b;padding-bottom:8px}
.hero{text-align:center;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#171717,#493400);padding:45px 15px;border-radius:15px}
.hero h1{font-size:32px;color:#ffd700}
.btn{display:inline-block;background:#ffd700;color:#111;padding:12px 20px;border-radius:8px;text-decoration:none;font-weight:bold;margin:8px;border:0}
.card{background:#171717;border:1px solid #806000;border-radius:12px;padding:18px;margin:12px 0}
input,textarea{width:100%;padding:12px;margin:8px 0;border-radius:6px;border:1px solid #b8860b;background:#222;color:white}
button{cursor:pointer}
.gallery{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(130px,1fr));gap:12px}
.gallery img{width:100%;height:150px;object-fit:cover;border-radius:9px}
footer{text-align:center;padding:25px;background:#171717;color:#ffd700}
</style>
</head>
<body>

<header>
<div class="logo">KJBM</div>
<p>Knowledge • Journey • Brilliance • Motivation</p>
<p>Welcome to the official KJBM website</p>
</header>

<nav>
<a href="#home">Home</a>
<a href="#about">About</a>
<a href="#gallery">Gallery</a>
<a href="#news">News</a>
<a href="#downloads">Downloads</a>
<a href="#contact">Contact</a>
<a href="#account">Account</a>
</nav>

<section id="home">
<div class="hero">
<h1>WELCOME TO KJBM</h1>
<p>A place for creativity, information, inspiration and connection.</p>
<a class="btn" href="#about">Discover KJBM</a>
<a class="btn" href="#news">Latest News</a>
</div>
</section>

<section id="about">
<h2>About KJBM</h2>
<div class="card">
<p>Welcome to KJBM! This is our online home, created to share information, ideas, photographs, news and announcements.</p>
<p>Explore our website and discover what KJBM has to offer.</p>
</div>
</section>

<section id="gallery">
<h2>Photo Gallery</h2>
<p>Select photographs from your phone to preview them here.</p>
<input type="file" id="photos" accept="image/*" multiple>
<div class="gallery" id="preview"></div>
</section>

<section id="news">
<h2>News and Announcements</h2>
<div class="card">
<h3>Welcome to KJBM!</h3>
<p>Our new website is here. Visit regularly for updates and announcements.</p>
</div>
<div class="card">
<h3>Stay Connected</h3>
<p>More exciting updates will be shared here.</p>
</div>
</section>

<section id="downloads">
<h2>Downloads</h2>
<div class="card">
<p>Files and useful resources will be shared here soon.</p>
</div>
</section>

<section id="contact">
<h2>Contact KJBM</h2>
<div class="card">
<p>Send us a message:</p>
<form onsubmit="event.preventDefault();alert('This is a demo form. Connect a form service to receive messages.');">
<input type="text" placeholder="Your name" required>
<input type="email" placeholder="Your email" required>
<textarea placeholder="Your message" rows="4" required></textarea>
<button class="btn" type="submit">Send Message</button>
</form>
</div>
</section>

<section id="account">
<h2>Login and Registration</h2>
<div class="card">
<p>Account feature preview. This demonstration does not create real accounts.</p>
<input type="text" placeholder="Username">
<input type="email" placeholder="Email address">
<button class="btn" onclick="alert('Account registration needs a secure account service.');">Register</button>
<button class="btn" onclick="alert('Login needs a secure account service.');">Login</button>
</div>
</section>

<footer>
<p>© 2026 KJBM. All Rights Reserved.</p>
<p>Creativity • Excellence • Inspiration</p>
</footer>

<script>
document.getElementById('photos').addEventListener('change',function(){
const preview=document.getElementById('preview');
preview.innerHTML='';
Array.from(this.files).forEach(file=>{
const img=document.createElement('img');
img.src=URL.createObjectURL(file);
preview.appendChild(img);
});
});
</script>

</body>
</html>
